{"id": "cm-x-mix", "title": "十組易混淆對照", "notesHtml": "<div class=\"kgrid\"><div class=\"kc\"><h4>初級 ／ 次級 ／ 三級輔導</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>初級</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">全體宣導預防</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>次級</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">出現困難及早介入</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>三級</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">嚴重危機跨專業醫療</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\"><h4>個人中心 ／ 現實治療</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>個人中心</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">接納同理相信成長</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>現實治療</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">選擇責任現在行動</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\"><h4>理情治療 (REBT) ／ 認知治療 (CBT)</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>REBT</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">抓「必須絕對」直接駁斥</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>CBT</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">當作假說合作找證據</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\"><h4>焦點解決 (SFBT) ／ 敘事治療</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>SFBT</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">向前看找例外與奇蹟</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>敘事</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">人非問題，外化解構重寫故事</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc hasneg\"><h4>自然後果 ／ 邏輯後果<span class=\"negb\">≠ 易誤判</span></h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>自然</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\"><span class=\"neg\">自然發生不人為</span></div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>邏輯</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">教師設計具邏輯補救性</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc hasneg\"><h4>合理調整 ／ 課程修改<span class=\"negb\">≠ 易誤判</span></h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>調整</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\"><span class=\"neg\">不改目標只改路徑方式</span></div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>修改</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">直接降低目標難度與標準</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\"><h4>通用設計 (UDL) ／ 個別化計畫 (IEP)</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>UDL</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">事前為全體多元設計</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>IEP</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">事後為個別特教生量身定做</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\"><h4>行為功能 (FBA) ／ 正向支持 (PBS)</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>FBA</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">以 ABC 找行為功能</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>PBS</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">以非懲罰手段教導替代行為</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc hasneg\"><h4>資優充實制 ／ 加速制<span class=\"negb\">≠ 易誤判</span></h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>充實</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\"><span class=\"neg\">加深加廣不跳級</span></div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>加速</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">加快進度跳級提早修</div></span></div></div><div class=\"kc\"><h4>Super ／ Holland</h4><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>Super</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">看一生角色發展歷程</div></span></div><div class=\"kf\"><span class=kl>Holland</span><span class=\"kv\"><div class=\"kline\">看人格特質與職業環境適配</div></span></div></div></div>", "questions": [], "recall": []}